        // dir is what failed. A local FS error is neither a
        // token-service outage nor retryable (the requeue hand-back
        // lives on the same volume): flag it so the tick reports
        // state_write_error instead of token_service_down and the
        // file fails pointing at the state dir, not at
        // vk-token.service.
